  kind: 2
  title: "Gi\u1EEFa k\u1EF3 \u2014 ng\xE0y 10"
  intro: "B\xE0i tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi nhi\u1EC5u nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n.
    Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xE1p \xE1n ch\u1EB7t ch\u1EBD nh\u1EA5t (ki\u1EC3u event h\xE0i
    h\u01B0\u1EDBc)."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 10] Ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u \u0111\xFAng v\u1EC1 '\u0111\u1ED9
      l\u1EC7ch chu\u1EA9n' m\u1EABu (th\u1ED1ng k\xEA c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n):"
    options:
    - "\u0110\u01A1n v\u1ECB gi\u1ED1ng \u0111\u01A1n v\u1ECB d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u g\u1ED1c"
    - "Lu\xF4n \xE2m"
    - "B\u1EB1ng ph\u01B0\u01A1ng sai"
    - "Kh\xF4ng nh\u1EA1y v\u1EDBi outliers"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 10] 'Big-O O(n)' th\u01B0\u1EDDng m\xF4 t\u1EA3
      \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n ti\u1EC7m c\u1EADn t\u1ED1c \u0111\u1ED9 t\u0103ng th\u1EDDi
      gian theo k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc input"
    - "B\u1ED9 nh\u1EDB ch\xEDnh x\xE1c t\xEDnh b\u1EB1ng byte"
    - "S\u1ED1 v\xF2ng l\u1EB7p t\u1ED1i \u0111a lu\xF4n = n"
    - "\u0110\u1ED9 ph\u1EE9c t\u1EA1p t\u1ED1i thi\u1EC3u c\u1EE7a m\u1ECDi thu\u1EADt
      to\xE1n"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 10] Trong l\u1EADp tr\xECnh, 'race condition'
      g\u1EA7n ngh\u0129a l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "K\u1EBFt qu\u1EA3 ph\u1EE5 thu\u1ED9c th\u1EE9 t\u1EF1/timing th\u1EF1c thi
      kh\xF4ng ki\u1EC3m so\xE1t"
    - "Ch\u1EA1y code tr\xEAn CPU qu\xE1 nhanh"
    - "L\u1ED7i c\xFA ph\xE1p"
    - "Thi\u1EBFu RAM"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 10] HTTP status 404 th\u01B0\u1EDDng ngh\u0129a
      l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Kh\xF4ng t\xECm th\u1EA5y t\xE0i nguy\xEAn"
    - "L\u1ED7i m\xE1y ch\u1EE7 n\u1ED9i b\u1ED9"
    - "Kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ph\xE9p"
    - "Qu\xE1 nhi\u1EC1u request"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 10] JSON h\u1EE3p l\u1EC7 th\u01B0\u1EDDng
      l\xE0 lo\u1EA1i d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u n\xE0o?"
    options:
    - "C\xE2y c\xFA ph\xE1p (object/array/string/number/bool/null)"
    - "B\u1EA3ng 2 c\u1ED9t duy nh\u1EA5t"
    - "Chu\u1ED7i nh\u1ECB ph\xE2n kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c"
    - "\u0110\u1ECBnh d\u1EA1ng \u1EA3nh"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
